<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Srinagar | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting JK-01
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad protect my bike from snow and moisture during Bike Transportation In Srinagar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We wrap every two‑wheeler in a seven‑layer, moisture‑proof system that starts with an 80‑GSM bubble sheet, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard, weather‑resistant stretch film, and a custom wooden crate. The final outer layer is a snow‑grade seal that repels moisture, ensuring the bike arrives pristine even in harsh winter conditions.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical turnaround time for bike transportation from Srinagar to major hubs like Delhi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our dedicated multi‑axle express freight lanes cover the 850 km Srinagar‑Delhi corridor in 2‑3 business days, depending on weather and traffic. Real‑time GPS tracking lets you monitor progress, and our pre‑loading audit guarantees the bike is ready for immediate dispatch, minimizing any idle time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any special documents required for bike parcel service on Indian Railways from Srinagar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. You need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a self‑declaration of ownership, and a GST‑compliant invoice if the shipment is for a corporate client. Our team also prepares the e‑Way bill and any additional railway parcel forms, ensuring seamless hand‑over without delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the pricing calculated for bike transportation in Srinagar and what factors influence the cost?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is distance‑based, starting with a fixed base fare for the first 100 km, then a per‑kilometer rate for the remaining distance. Additional factors include bike size, any extra protective packaging, insurance coverage level, and special handling like hydraulic ramp loading. Seasonal surcharges may apply during peak winter months.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Does the full transit insurance cover accidental damage and theft during the journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 100 % IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covers accidental damage, collision, and theft for the entire route. The policy is declared‑value based, meaning you can insure the bike for its market price. In the unlikely event of a claim, we handle documentation and settlement swiftly.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can corporate or government departments claim reimbursement using the bills provided for bike relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our invoices are IBA mover‑code approved, ISO‑certified, and GST‑registered, making them fully compliant for reimbursement claims by central or state government bodies, PSUs, and corporate accounts. We also issue separate defense‑grade bills for military relocations upon request.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
